// Title: OSACompile Run-Only Execution
// ID: b9d9b652-d8ed-4697-89a2-a1186ee680ac
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Sohan G (D4rkCiph3r)
// Date: 2023-01-31
// Tags: attack.t1059.002, attack.execution
// Description: Detects potential suspicious run-only executions compiled using OSACompile
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((process.command_line like "*_osacompile*" and process.command_line like "*_ -x *" and process.command_line like "*_ -e *"))
